---
description: Project rules — always apply
alwaysApply: true
---

All project rules live in `/AGENTS.md` at the repo root. Read it and follow it
for every change: the SSOT map, the laziness ladder, DRY/SSOT rules, Convex
correctness (auth on every mutation, index don't scan), the no-AI-slop frontend
rules, and the add-a-feature golden path.

Before shipping, walk `/CHECKLIST.md` — the single ship checklist (SEO,
performance, security, accessibility, data, UX states, testing, deploy). Gate:
`bun run check` → `bun run build` → drive the flow in the browser.

This package manager here is **bun** (`bun install`, `bun run <script>`,
`bunx <cli>`). There is no npm lockfile.

This file intentionally holds no rules of its own so it can't drift from
AGENTS.md / CHECKLIST.md.
